{{Term/Store|Red Sparrow|Red Sparrows|Series, BotW, TotK|plural}} are recurring [[Creature]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref>{{Cite|'''Red Sparrow'''|Hyrule Compendium|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|'''Red Sparrow'''|Hyrule Compendium|TotK}}</ref>

==Characteristics==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Red Sparrow}}
Red Sparrows are a type of [[Sparrow]].<ref>{{Cite Book|quote= |book= CaC |publisher= |page= 164}}</ref> They live among the mountains of the [[Hebra]] [[Region]], specifically on the [[Hebra Mountains]] proper and the [[Tabantha Frontier]].<ref name="Compendium">{{Cite|These small birds live in the Hebra region and eat mainly nuts and wild plants. Their bright- red feathers are often used as decorations. |Hyrule Compendium|BotW}}</ref> These Sparrows gather in groups, but they will fly away if they are disturbed. They maintain a herbivorous diet, feeding mainly on nuts and wild plants, and their feathers are commonly used for decorations.<ref name="Compendium"/> When killed, Red Sparrows will drop [[Chickaloo Tree Nut]]s.

